# Testing standards

Use .ai/skills/testing-standards as the complete reference.

- Test names describe business rules, not implementation mechanics.
- Use AAA with blank lines between Arrange, Act and Assert.
- Tests must be fast, isolated, repeatable, self-validating and timely.
- Use InMemory repositories for UseCase unit tests.
- Do not mock repositories.
- Never weaken a test to make implementation pass.
- Use fake non-production secrets only.
- Run pnpm test or the smallest focused script available.
